@startuml task-lifecycle
' The AgentTask phase machine: every phase and the transition that moves
' between them, one trigger per edge. Triggers and their mechanics are the
' table on docs/src/controller/task-lifecycle.md.
!include _style.puml

state Pending
state Provisioning
state Running
state Completing
state Succeeded
state Failed
state TimedOut
state Terminating
state "any phase" as Any #F5F5F5

[*] --> Pending
Pending --> Provisioning : Certificate created
Provisioning --> Running : Pod Ready
Running --> Completing : completion, exit, or timeout
Completing --> Succeeded : success
Completing --> Failed : failure
Completing --> TimedOut : timeout, onTimeout Fail
Pending --> Failed : spec irreconcilable
Provisioning --> Failed : Pod start failed,\nspec irreconcilable
Running --> Failed : Pod lost, mailbox empty
Failed --> Provisioning : retries left
Any --> Terminating : deleted, or TTL expired
@enduml
